    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get ready for a ghostly good time in <i>Pumpkin Spice</i>, the ultimate 2D maze adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide a playful little ghost through spooky mazes, from the grave to pumpkin. Dodge mischievous bad guys, collect candy dropped by a flying witch, and uncover whether it's a trick or a treat! With vibrant visuals, simple controls, and fun challenges, <i>Pumpkin Spice</i> is perfect for kids and casual gamers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf83 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing, easy-to-play gameplay with charming Halloween vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Candy surprises with power-ups\u2014or pranks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of mazes to explore and conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for kids, families, and anyone looking for festive fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this spooktacular journey and see if you have what it takes to outwit the maze!</p>",
